  "description": "David Attias was working in finance when he discovered an app making $200K/month. He thought the app was genius. So he rebuilt it in a different niche, and five months later, STOPPR is generating $12K/month with zero coding background required. This video breaks down David's full app building playbook.\n\n🚀 Turn a few sentences into a full-stack app → https://go.starterstory.com/stoppr\n\n🛠️ Want to build your own app with AI? Check out Starter Story Build → https://build.starterstory.com/build/ai-build-accelerator?utm_source=youtube&utm_campaign=stoppr\n\nDavid's app: https://www.stoppr.app/\nFollow David: https://x.com/david_attisaas\n\n🔔 Follow the Second Channel: ‪@StarterStoryBuild‬ \n🏁 We're hiring: starterstory.com/jobs\n\nChapters:\n0:00 - Intro\n1:25 - What is the app?\n1:57 - Numbers behind the app\n2:21 - From stockbroker to app builder\n3:57 - Building approach\n4:38 - Validating the idea\n5:13 - How David built his app\n5:47 - App cloning playbook\n7:05 - Tech stack and costs\n8:08 - David's final advice\n9:07 - Pat's notes and reflections",
